name wikidata
# Wikidata full entity JSON dump (latest-all.json / *.jsonl, optionally gzipped): one JSON entity object per line
# (items Q..., properties P..., lexemes L...), carrying multilingual labels, descriptions, aliases, property claims
# keyed by P..., and sitelinks.
witness Wikidata
class UserCuratedResource
root $LAPLACE_DATA/Wikidata
held "Wikidata JSONL dump not staged on this host"
after unicode iso-639
